<div>
	<h2>About Me</h2>
	<p>Hi. My name's Theo. I am 15 years old (about to turn 16), and I live with my parents, sister, and cat (Amber).</p>
	<p>
		At school, I study a couple of subjects. I attend The Friends School and am in year 10, and like most other students
		in my year group, I study 5 core subjects 2 electives, and an extra year 10 class (futures). For four of my core
		subjects I study: English, Humanities, HPE, and Science Extended. For my Mathematics class, I have actually been
		accelerated to a course in the TCE, Mathematics Methods 415. My electives are French, and Programming. I have also
		been in a Computer Graphics class for a semester.
	</p>
	<p>
		I have a couple of interests and hobbies that take up my personal life as well. Most notably, I enjoy playing video
		games. I mainly play these on my <i> Nintendo Switch 2</i>, and have various mainline Nintendo titles such as
		<i> Super Mario Odyssey</i>, <i> The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild</i>, and <i> Splatoon 3</i>. I also have a
		<i> PlayStation 4</i>, which I use occasionally. I like to read often, and I am aiming on developing skills in game
		development in the near future, as this is what I want to do as a future career.
	</p>

